---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const personSchema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  '@id': 'https://beyondpanamarelocation.com/en/about/#author',
  name: 'Moisés Alvarado',
  jobTitle: 'Founder, Beyond Panama Relocation',
  url: 'https://beyondpanamarelocation.com/en/about',
  worksFor: {
    '@type': 'Organization',
    name: 'Beyond Panama Relocation',
    url: 'https://beyondpanamarelocation.com',
  },
  knowsAbout: [
    'Panama relocation',
    'Panama immigration',
    'Panama real estate',
    'Expat life in Panama',
    'Panama visa options',
    'International relocation',
  ],
  description:
    `Founder of Beyond Panama Relocation. Has worked in international relocation and the Panamanian real estate market, advising foreigners on navigating Panama's visa system, neighborhoods, and cost of living.`,
};
---
<Layout
  title="About — Moisés Alvarado &amp; Beyond Panama Relocation"
  description="Beyond Panama Relocation is an independent information portal for people considering a move to Panama — founded by Moisés Alvarado, a relocation consultant with direct experience in Panama's real estate and immigration landscape."
  lang="en"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(personSchema)} />

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <a href="/en/" class="text-jade text-sm hover:underline">← Home</a>

    <header class="mt-4 mb-12">
      <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl text-slate mb-4">About Beyond Panama</h1>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-xl leading-relaxed">Beyond Panama is not a real estate agency. Not a law firm. Not a travel agent. We're an independent information portal for people who want to move to Panama and want to understand the landscape before making any decision.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10">

      <!-- Who we are — E-E-A-T: named expert with verifiable experience claims -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-4">Who we are</h2>
        <div class="flex gap-5 items-start p-6 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mois%C3%A9s-alvarado-n/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="shrink-0 mt-1" aria-label="Moisés Alvarado on LinkedIn">
            <img src="/moises-alvarado.jpg" alt="Moisés Alvarado" class="w-14 h-14 rounded-full object-cover ring-2 ring-jade/20" />
          </a>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-slate mb-1">Moisés Alvarado — Founder &amp; Editor</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-jade font-medium tracking-wide uppercase mb-1">Relocation consultant · Panama real estate market</p>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/mois%C3%A9s-alvarado-n/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs text-slate-mid hover:text-jade transition-colors mb-3">
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M20.447 20.452h-3.554v-5.569c0-1.328-.027-3.037-1.852-3.037-1.853 0-2.136 1.445-2.136 2.939v5.667H9.351V9h3.414v1.561h.046c.477-.9 1.637-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.601 0 4.267 2.37 4.267 5.455v6.286zM5.337 7.433a2.062 2.062 0 0 1-2.063-2.065 2.064 2.064 0 1 1 2.063 2.065zm1.782 13.019H3.555V9h3.564v11.452zM22.225 0H1.771C.792 0 0 .774 0 1.729v20.542C0 23.227.792 24 1.771 24h20.451C23.2 24 24 23.227 24 22.271V1.729C24 .774 23.2 0 22.222 0h.003z"/></svg>
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed text-sm mb-3">
              Moisés has worked directly in international relocation and the Panamanian real estate market — which means he's seen both sides: the complexity people face when choosing a visa category, picking a neighborhood, and estimating real monthly costs, and the information gaps that cause expensive mistakes. Beyond Panama was built from that direct experience — not as a service business, but as the resource Moisés wished had existed when he started working in this field.
            </p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed text-sm">
              Every guide on this site is written from direct knowledge of Panama's immigration system, real estate market, and day-to-day expat life — not from secondary sources or generic relocation content.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Editorial approach — signals depth of experience -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">Our editorial approach</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-2">Primary sources only</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Statistics and legal requirements are sourced from Panama's Servicio Nacional de Migración (SNM), official government publications, and direct market observation — not from other expat blogs. Each guide cites its source and date.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-2">No invented numbers</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Cost figures (rents, visa fees, monthly budgets) reflect real prices observed in the Panamanian market during the period noted. We don't quote the "brochure number" — we quote what people actually pay.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-2">Updated when rules change</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">Panama's immigration rules, visa requirements, and official fees change. When they do, the relevant guide is updated with the new information and the change date noted. Outdated information on an immigration site can cost someone a visa rejection.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-2">Comparative, not prescriptive</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">We present multiple visa routes and multiple areas honestly — including the drawbacks of each. The goal is for you to make a well-informed decision, not to steer you toward the option that earns us a referral.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Why Beyond Panama exists -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">Why Beyond Panama exists</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">Moving to another country has too many moving parts. Most of the information available about Panama comes from people who have something to sell you: real estate agents earning commission, law firms charging per process, or blogs monetizing with affiliates.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed mt-4">Beyond Panama exists to be the opposite: neutral, comparative, and up-to-date information, without sales pressure. The idea is that you reach a decision because you understood it — not because someone convinced you.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Who visits Beyond Panama -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-5">Who comes to Beyond Panama</h2>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">🌴</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Retirees</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Looking for a warmer, more affordable life with quality healthcare. Beyond Panama helps them navigate the Pensionado visa, compare areas, and understand real monthly costs before they commit to anything.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">💻</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Remote professionals</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Earning in USD, wanting to stretch their income in a stable, connected city. Beyond Panama covers the Digital Nomad and Friendly Nations visa routes, neighborhood breakdowns for Panama City, and the practicalities of setting up life here.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl border border-jade/15 bg-white">
            <div class="text-2xl mb-2">📈</div>
            <p class="font-medium text-slate text-sm mb-1">Investors</p>
            <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs leading-relaxed">
              Considering property or looking for a residency pathway tied to investment. Beyond Panama maps the Qualified Investor and Friendly Nations routes honestly — including the risks — so they can decide with full information.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- How it works -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">How it works</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed">The site is free. We charge nothing to readers. If after exploring the content you want to move forward with a legal or real estate process, we discreetly connect you with qualified professionals — that's what we call a referral. Beyond Panama may receive compensation for that connection, without it changing the cost or quality of service you receive.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-mid leading-relaxed mt-4">When you're ready to take the next concrete step, visit our <a href="/en/next-steps/" class="text-jade hover:underline">Next Steps guide</a> — it walks you through what to do first, how to prepare your documents, and how to avoid the most common first-mover mistakes.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- What we don't do -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl text-slate mb-3">What we don't do</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-mid">
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't handle visa or residency applications under our brand</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't sell properties or manage our own real estate inventory</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't use fake urgency or sales superlatives</li>
          <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-coral mt-1">✗</span> We don't invent testimonials or statistics</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- CTA to quiz -->
    <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-jade/5 border border-jade/15 text-center">
      <p class="font-serif text-xl text-slate mb-2">Not sure where to start?</p>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-sm mb-5">The quiz takes 2 minutes and gives you a personalized starting point — no pressure, no sign-up required.</p>
      <a href="/en/quiz/" class="inline-flex px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-jade text-white font-medium text-sm hover:bg-jade-dark transition-colors">Start the quiz →</a>
      <p class="text-slate-mid text-xs mt-5">Or read what others say — <a href="/en/testimonials/" class="text-jade hover:underline">real experiences from people who moved to Panama</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
